      "writtenOn": "2026-03-28T17:08:45Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "It looks like it is valid to set either start_time or end_time and not the other. When you only set start_time it seems to get results from that start time until the current time. When you only set end_time it seems to get the 5k results prior to the end time. I think that is fine for setting one for the other.\n\nHowever, when I set start time \u003e end_time (eg end_time is not \u003e\u003d start_time) I get a page with the time toolbar and no graph or message at all.\n\nI wonder if we should add a check here ensuring that end_time \u003e\u003d start_time if both are set and if not we can provide a warning to the user?",
      "revId": "744a70766628f50736d08f6f50be4491a4ec3a72",
      "serverId": "4a232e18-c5a9-48ee-94c0-e04e7cca6543"
